# Auth for the Claude Code agents spawned by sandcastle.
#
# Because this workflow uses noSandbox() — the agents run directly on THIS
# Windows host — `claude` will use whatever credentials the host CLI is already
# logged in with. If you have run `claude` interactively and authenticated with
# your subscription, you can leave CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN blank.
#
# To pin an explicit subscription token instead (e.g. for an unattended run on a
# machine where the CLI is not logged in), generate one with:
#     claude setup-token
# and paste it below. This is a subscription OAuth token, NOT an API key.
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
